A RE must obtain an Aadhaar number from customers:
- For all new individual accounts opened on/after July 1, 2017;
- For existing individuals when upgrading/renewing accounts beyond Rs. 50,000 credit balance (or higher thresholds for specific services);
- For transactions ≥ Rs. 2 lakh (single) or ≥ Rs. 10 lakh (cumulative annual).
*(Exemptions apply only as per RBI’s KYC MD/PMLA Rules for non-residents or other specified cases.)
